.svn/
# Qt FloorBoard source: only the data the tools read (and its license) are kept in git
/gt-3fxfloorboard_source_code_20250420/*
!/gt-3fxfloorboard_source_code_20250420/license.txt
!/gt-3fxfloorboard_source_code_20250420/midi.xml
!/gt-3fxfloorboard_source_code_20250420/default.syx
